+						 * pass: keep_cx, if
+						 * keep_cx>SKIP_PANEL_INIT
+						 * Panel Init Page will
+						 * be skipped, if
+						 * >SKIP_PANEL_CX_INIT
+						 * Cx and Panel Init
+						 * Pages will be skipped
+						 * otherwise if
+						 * =ERASE_ALL all the
+						 * pages will be deleted
+						 * */
+
